{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Gate status hold (as of this comment): change 1919 patch set 1 is up with LLM-Review, Verified and Code-Review all still 'pending' ~2h after push. The Gerrit Verified Gate run (GH Actions 32306169771) reports job 'require resolvable rebar ticket' as queued, and EVERY GitHub Actions run in navapbc/rebar over the same window is likewise stuck queued (including unrelated dependabot 'Test Suite (mirror)' runs) — i.e. runner-pool starvation, not a failure of this change. No 'recheck' was issued: nothing has failed, and a recheck would only enqueue another job behind the same stalled pool. Ticket deliberately left in_progress; it must not close until the change is Verified +1 and merged."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787176771787995001,"uuid":"aa0b4407-d745-4865-9ee5-5da969fd5c84"}